{"name": "D-BEAT HEROES", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/5c5ff925766c3e13aa902f46e62094fb.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"640\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"90\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/a53763546e4c5e6aeda1ec0468084201.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"640\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wow! LADY DEBELLIA is trying to take over the world again, and it's up to some ragtag teenagers to stop her! Help DJ and his friends take on the roles of DEFENSE ENFORCERS, masked teenage heroes put into the spotlight to protect DAYLIGHT CITY! Can they protect the city not only from  LADY DEBELLIA and her nefarious D-BEASTS, but also from scheming celebrities, manic TV personalities, good-turned-evil DEFENSE ENFORCERS, and w\u0334\u0335\u0334 h\u0334\u0335\u0337 e\u0336\u0335\u0335 r\u0334\u0338\u0335 e\u0336\u0335\u0336\u00a0 \u0334\u00a0t\u0336\u031b\u0323 h\u0336\u0309\u033d\u032a\u031f e\u0338\u031b\u035d\u0344\u0332\u0321y\u0334\u033f\u034e\u0355\u0329\u034e\u0321 \u1e75\u0338 o\u2a20\u0338 y\u0334\u0337\u0336\u033e\u0335\u0308\u0335\u035b\u0334\u0325\u0337\u0353\u0336\u0317\u0336\u00a0 \u0334 \u2587\u0337\u221c\u2587\u0337\u2637\u2587\u0337\u2674\u2587\u0337\u0b74\u2586\u2587 \u2588\u2588\u25a0\u2593f\u0335\u0314\u0341\u0332\u2593\u2140l\u2593 \u2593m\u0338\u034a\u0309\u033d\u0301\u0346\u0315\u033f\u0322\u032c\u212d\u0334\u0315\u0348\u033b\u25a0\u0335\u0346\u030a\u0324\u2593\u2127\u0337\u0357\u030a\u0348\u2593\u2593\u211f\u0338\u0313\u033a\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u00a0 \u22c4 \u22c4 \u22c4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Only time will tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"90\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/63febb5a0f17d383b29cb679c19e5f72.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"640\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use a wide variety of abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"458\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/df891341cba02306c6b45553c017c9da.poster.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"612\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/df891341cba02306c6b45553c017c9da.webm?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/df891341cba02306c6b45553c017c9da.mp4?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Defense Enforcer comes equipped with their own weapon and two abilities. Mix and match what abilities you bring into battle based on enemy weaknesses or your preferred playstyle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swap between different heroes in the middle of battle!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"462\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/598f662b445d94b81fc710497a4031ff.poster.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/598f662b445d94b81fc710497a4031ff.webm?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/598f662b445d94b81fc710497a4031ff.mp4?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don't just use one Defense Enforcer in battle! Each Defense Enforcer has their own move set to use in battle! Swap  among your teammates continuously to attack or swap at the right time strategically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend yourself against a changing grid!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"406\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/2c2ac01fa47296c3450610f37646e50a.poster.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"542\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/2c2ac01fa47296c3450610f37646e50a.webm?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/2c2ac01fa47296c3450610f37646e50a.mp4?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The grid won't stay constant forever. Enemies can manipulate the dimensions and properties of the grid in their favor to unleash devastating attacks. Adapt well to make sure you don't get caught off-guard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Replay exciting battles and challenge yourself in Arcade Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/36d1bddcc156e770634df2c49cf30c01.poster.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"400\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/36d1bddcc156e770634df2c49cf30c01.webm?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/36d1bddcc156e770634df2c49cf30c01.mp4?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the middle of Chapter 1, you'll be able to unlock Arcade Mode! Arcade Mode allows you to replay fights you've experienced before in Story Mode, but with additional difficulty levels and attack patterns! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defeating enemies in Arcade Mode will also automatically grant rewards to all of your story save files. Your best clear times and grades are saved as well, so work towards getting the best record possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore the City!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/2b445bbb4e4927a1d587062a1bdca26a.poster.avif?t=1784656450\" width=\"438\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/2b445bbb4e4927a1d587062a1bdca26a.webm?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/extras/2b445bbb4e4927a1d587062a1bdca26a.mp4?t=1784656450\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Life isn't just about battling against the evil forces of LADY DEBELLIA. Explore DAYLIGHT CITY and see the wonder it has to offer in its townsfolk and environment. Grab food to eat, buy something for yourself, or help out people with things they should honestly do by themselves, but won't!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "D-BEAT HEROES is a grid-based tag-team action RPG! Choose powerful abilities to take with you into combat and fight against your enemies on the grid! Protect Daylight City from the forces of evil and maintain order. Do it before it's too late!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531890/0a0f6a486aa25494be28f5dd5332db65c73c2573/header.jpg?t=1784656450", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action RPG", "Superhero", "Grid-Based Movement", "RPG", "Hack and Slash", "Action"], "developers": "jqtran.dev", "publishers": "jqtran.dev", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3531890", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/S_MNIYBoKwM", "first_seen": 1780005600.0, "review_rank": 540}